        <attribute name="Description" id="1373" net="1">
          <![CDATA[An original 80s-style synth-pop song as a music net: synth intro, verse with melody and bass in parallel, pre-chorus, chorus with melody, bass and drums in parallel, then a repeated chorus, second verse or outro, and back to the start.]]>
